=== mimic ===
You: "Best Friend! Is that you??"

Mimic: "OMG! Hiii!! Come over here and help me pick flowers! They're so pretty!"

* [Help pick flowers]
    You: "Oooo okay, I'll help you."
    -> mimic_lose

* [Don't help pick flowers]
    You hesitate and remember your best friend is allergic to flowers.
    You: "Ummm... no. Aren't you allergic to flowers?"
    Mimic: "Mwahaahahah"
    The mimic disappears, and suddenly you're in a treehouse above the flower field.
    Best Friend: "Over here!"
    -> ending

=== mimic_lose ===
You help pick the flowers and realize they're poisonous, get lightheaded, and fall to the ground.
-> END